{"resource": {"attributes": {"telemetry.sdk.language": "rust", "service.version": "0.147.0", "host.name": "mini", "env": "production", "service.name": "codex_cli_rs", "telemetry.sdk.name": "opentelemetry", "telemetry.sdk.version": "0.31.0"}, "dropped_attributes_count": 0, "entity_refs": [], "schema_url": null}, "scope": {"name": "codex_otel.log_only", "version": null, "attributes": {}, "dropped_attributes_count": 0, "schema_url": null}, "receiver": {"transport": "grpc", "peer_ip": "::1", "metadata": []}, "time": null, "observed_time": "2026-08-17T15:19:42.898946998Z", "severity_number": 9, "severity_text": "INFO", "body": {"kind": "empty", "string_value": null, "bool_value": null, "int_value": null, "double_value": null, "bytes_value": null, "json_value": null}, "attributes": {"event.name": "codex.tool_result", "event.kind": null, "input_token_count": null, "output_token_count": null, "cached_token_count": null, "cache_write_token_count": null, "reasoning_token_count": null, "tool_token_count": null, "ttft_ms": null, "model_reasoning_effort": null, "event.timestamp": "2026-08-17T15:19:42.898Z", "conversation.id": "01a00f60-9e12-7923-a5df-1f4fb1b1e479", "app.version": "0.147.0", "auth_mode": "Chatgpt", "originator": "codex-tui", "user.account_id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003", "user.email": "agent-user@example.com", "terminal.type": "xterm-256color", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "slug": "gpt-5.6-sol", "tool_name": "exec", "call_id": "call_VuI8QanMIqiSS3DX9HR55mP7", "decision": null, "source": null, "arguments": "const r = await tools.exec_command({\"cmd\":\"cat /home/user/Workspace/tenzir/mono.otel/AGENTS.md\\ncat /home/user/Workspace/tenzir/mono.otel/engine/AGENTS.md\\nrg -n \\\"devShell|mkShell|CMakePresets|nix develop|cmake --preset|nix-clang-debug|CLion|IDE\\\" /home/user/Workspace/tenzir/mono.otel/engine/{flake.nix,README.md,CMakePresets.json} /home/user/Workspace/tenzir/mono.otel/README.md | head -160\",\"workdir\":\"/home/user/nixos-config\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":20000});\ntext(r.output);\n", "duration_ms": "93", "success": "true", "output": "Script completed\nWall time 0.1 seconds\nOutput:\n\n# Tenzir monorepo\n\nAll Tenzir development happens in this repository.\n\n## Layout\n\nEach top-level directory contains a dedicated project that can be built\nand distributed independently.\n\n- `engine/` \u2014 the open-source Tenzir engine (C++/CMake). Treat it as the\n  engine's own project root: its `CMakePresets.json`, `flake.nix`, `scripts/`,\n  and tests all live there, and every engine command below runs from inside it.\n  **See [`engine/AGENTS.md`](engine/AGENTS.md) for everything about working on\n  the engine** \u2014 directory structure, build presets, running pipelines, unit\n  and integration tests, formatting, and conventions.\n- `engine/plugins/` \u2014 the plugins, open-source and proprietary alike, one\n  directory per plugin.\n- `deployment/` \u2014 proprietary executables that use libtenzir as a library\n  rather than extending it. Its own CMake project: it consumes an installed\n  Tenzir through `find_package(Tenzir)` and is not part of the engine build.\n  See [`deployment/README.md`](deployment/README.md).\n- Repo root \u2014 monorepo-wide tooling only: the formatter (`flake.nix` +\n  `nix/treefmt.nix`), Git hooks (`lefthook.yml`), and the shared editor and\n  formatter configs (`.clang-format`, `.cmake-format`, `.editorconfig`, \u2026).\n# Tenzir\n\nTenzir is a data pipeline engine for security teams. It collects, parses,\nshapes, enriches, and routes security telemetry with a unified dataflow\nlanguage. The Tenzir Query Language (TQL) is a domain-specific language for\nbuilding modular pipelines that process structured event data.\n\n### Project structure\n\n- `.agents/` - Agent-facing reference material\n- `.docs/` - Optional local clone of the `tenzir/content` repository\n- `.github/` - GitHub configuration and CI/CD workflows\n- `changelog/` - Changelog entries and release metadata\n  - Managed with the `tenzir-ship` framework\n  - Reference: https://tenzir.com/docs/reference/ship-framework.md\n- `cmake/` - CMake build system modules and utilities\n  - Various CMake modules for dependencies\n  \n[... telemetry preview truncated ...]", "mcp_server": "", "mcp_server_origin": "", "auth.env_openai_api_key_present": null, "auth.env_codex_api_key_present": null, "auth.env_codex_api_key_enabled": null, "auth.env_refresh_token_url_override_present": null, "auth.connection_reused": null}, "dropped_attributes_count": 0, "flags": 1, "trace_id": "11046e03ce1fa71bd026ecef98e52fd6", "span_id": "477d9c3ecb115267", "event_name": "event otel/src/events/session_telemetry.rs:1122"}
